<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="badge">Case study</div>
    <h1>Previous work: from invisible online to <span class="accent">looking like the experts they are.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">A Dublin fibre optic &amp; structured cabling business with 30+ years of experience — but a website that didn't show it. Here's the rebuild.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="ba-grid">
      <div class="ba-card before">
        <div class="ba-head">Before <span class="pill">Typical issue</span></div>
        <div class="ba-mock before-mock">
          <div class="mock-inner">
            <div class="mock-nav"><span>HOME</span><span>SERVICES</span><span>ABOUT</span><span>CONTACT</span></div>
            <div class="mock-title">Trade Co.</div>
            <div class="mock-line w80"></div>
            <div class="mock-line w60"></div>
            <div class="mock-line w40"></div>
            <span class="mock-btn">Contact Us</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-body">
          <p class="ba-note">Illustrative — common issues with older B2B trade sites like this one.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>No mobile-friendly layout for on-site / on-call enquiries</li>
            <li>No clear call-to-action — phone number buried in text</li>
            <li>Doesn't communicate 30+ years of experience at a glance</li>
            <li>No way to capture a visitor before they leave the page</li>
            <li>Dated visuals that undersell a technical, established business</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ba-card after">
        <div class="ba-head">After <span class="pill">Southline rebuild</span></div>
        <div class="ba-mock after-mock">
          <div class="mock-inner">
            <div class="mock-badge">24/7 on-call</div>
            <h4>Fibre Optic &amp; Structured Cabling</h4>
            <div class="mock-sub">30+ years experience · Dublin &amp; nationwide</div>
            <span class="mock-cta">Call Now</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-body">
          <p class="ba-note">The actual rebuild — live and clickable.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Fully responsive, mobile-first design</li>
            <li>Click-to-call &amp; email buttons above the fold</li>
            <li>Services, credentials and stats laid out clearly</li>
            <li>Professional branding that matches the expertise on offer</li>
            <li>Built-in chatbot to capture enquiries 24/7</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="ba-link" href="{{ settings.case_study_demo_url | default: '#' }}" target="_blank">View live demo →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block alt">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="center">
      <p class="label">What we changed</p>
      <h2 class="title">Same business. Different first impression.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num mono">01</div>
        <h3>Led with credibility</h3>
        <p>30+ years and 24/7 on-call moved straight into the hero — the things that actually win trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num mono">02</div>
        <h3>One-tap contact</h3>
        <p>Phone and email buttons visible the second the page loads, on any device.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num mono">03</div>
        <h3>Clear service breakdown</h3>
        <p>Design, install, maintain, supply — laid out so a visitor knows exactly what's offered in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num mono">04</div>
        <h3>Always-on enquiries</h3>
        <p>A built-in chatbot captures details from visitors even outside office hours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block final">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2>Want a rebuild like this for your business?</h2>
    <p>Tell our assistant your trade and area — we'll build your demo free, you decide after.</p>
    <button class="btn-primary" onclick="openChat()">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
      Chat to Southline
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

